sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant App as ASP.NET Core App
    participant UserManager
    participant Database

    User->>Browser: Enter email & password
    Browser->>App: POST /login
    App->>App: Validate form input
    App->>UserManager: AuthenticateUserAsync(email, password)
    UserManager->>Database: GetUserByEmailAsync(email)
    Database-->>UserManager: User object
    UserManager->>UserManager: Verify password
    UserManager-->>App: Authentication result with User
    
    alt Authentication Success
        App->>Database: Get user role
        Database-->>App: Role name
        App->>App: Create claims (Name, Email, Role)
        App->>App: Create ClaimsIdentity
        App->>App: Create authentication cookie
        App->>Browser: Set cookie & redirect to role-based page
        Browser-->>User: Show appropriate UI
    else Authentication Failure
        App-->>Browser: Return to login page with error
        Browser-->>User: Show error message
    end